      "name": "FindAndJoinBnetGameByName",
      "signature": "int FindAndJoinBnetGameByName(void * this, byte * param_1, uint * param_2)",
      "calling_convention": "__thiscall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "FindAndJoinBnetGameByName - Searches the Battle.net game list for a matching game by name and initiates join\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_pGameListHead (head of linked list of games)\n2. Return 0 if game list is empty\n3. Iterate through linked list of game nodes\n4. Compare game name at node+0x04 with pszGameName using strcmp-like loop\n5. If names match (strcmp returns 0): store pContext at node+0x90\n6. Call ParseGameNodeDescriptionString to parse game description\n7. Determine render mode based on node flags at +0x8A\n8. If flag bit 0x04 clear OR flag bit 0x08 set then mode equals 5\n9. Otherwise mode equals 1\n10. Call InitCompositeUnitWeapon with node data\n11. Call RenderBnetListVisibleItems to refresh UI\n12. Return 1 on success\n13. If no match advance to next node via pointer at +0xA0\n14. Return 0 if no matching game found\n\nParameters:\n  this (ECX)          - void ptr: Context pointer stored in matching game node at +0x90\n  pszGameName         - byte ptr: Game name string to search for (Stack 0x04)\n  pszDescription      - char ptr: Game description string for ParseGameNodeDescriptionString (Stack 0x08)\n\nReturns:\n  1 (TRUE) if game found and join initiated\n  0 (FALSE) if no matching game found in list\n\nGameNode Structure Offsets:\n  +0x04    char[50]   szGameName (compared with search string)\n  +0x66    byte[16]   abClassData (component data for InitCompositeUnitWeapon)\n  +0x76    char[16]   szComponentColors (color string for InitCompositeUnitWeapon)\n  +0x8A    ushort     wFlags (game flags bits 0x04 and 0x08)\n  +0x90    void ptr   pJoinContext (context pointer for join operation)\n  +0x9C    uint ptr   pCompositeUnit (pointer to composite unit data)\n  +0xA0    void ptr   pNext (next node in linked list)\n\nFlag Bits at +0x8A:\n  0x04 - Controls render mode selection\n  0x08 - Overrides mode to 5 when set with 0x04\n\nGlobal:\n  g_pGameListHead (0x6fa21a90) - Head of Battle.net game linked list",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
