      "name": "UpdateUIElementsOnTextChange",
      "signature": "void UpdateUIElementsOnTextChange(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Updates Battle.net UI element visibility based on edit box text content and chat history state.\n\nClassification: Worker function - Called by EnterBattleNetMultiplayerUI and OnEditBoxTextChangedCallback\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get edit box child text from g_pCurrentInputPointer via D2Win_GetEditBoxChild\n2. Check if text pointer is non-NULL and string length > 0; set fHasText flag (ESI)\n3. Call SetUnitBitMask on g_apBnetUIObjects[5] with fHasText (Join Game button)\n4. Call SetUnitBitMask on g_apBnetUIObjects[0] with fHasText (Create Game button)\n5. Compute fCanSendChat = (g_pChatHistoryBuffer != NULL) AND fHasText\n6. Call SetUnitBitMask on g_apBnetUIObjects[1] with fCanSendChat (Send button)\n7. If g_pChatHistoryBuffer exists and has player pointer at offset 0x9C:\n   a. Get unit ID from player pointer via GetUnitIdFromPointer\n   b. Mask result with gdwBitMasks[9] (bit 9 = 0x200, whisper target flag)\n8. Compute fCanWhisper = (g_pChatHistoryBuffer != NULL) AND (dwMaskedId == 0)\n9. Call SetUnitBitMask on g_apBnetUIObjects[3] with fCanWhisper (Whisper button)\n10. If g_pChatHistoryBuffer exists AND dwMaskedId != 0:\n    Call SetUnitBitMask on g_apBnetUIObjects[4] with 1 (Squelch button enabled)\n11. Else: Call SetUnitBitMask on g_apBnetUIObjects[4] with 0 (Squelch disabled)\n\nParameters: None (uses globals)\n\nReturns: void\n\nGlobals Accessed:\n  g_pCurrentInputPointer (0x6fa218d0) - Current edit box control pointer\n  g_apBnetUIObjects (0x6fa216a8) - Array of UI element pointers:\n    [0] = Create Game button\n    [1] = Send button\n    [3] = Whisper button\n    [4] = Squelch button\n    [5] = Join Game button\n  g_pChatHistoryBuffer (0x6fa21aa4) - Chat history structure pointer\n    +0x9C = Pointer to selected player unit\n  gdwBitMasks_exref (0x6fa1922c) - External bitmask array pointer\n    [9] (+0x24) = Whisper target validation mask (0x200)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - If edit box is empty, Join/Create/Send buttons are disabled\n  - Whisper button enabled only when chat buffer exists but no whisper target selected\n  - Squelch button enabled only when valid whisper target is selected",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:ca61a268a88729ffcfe47c58deccc210",
