      "name": "CompletePendingSessionRequest",
      "signature": "void CompletePendingSessionRequest(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "CompletePendingSessionRequest - Finalizes a pending MCP session request and stores the request ID\n\nClassification: Worker function - called to complete pending session requests for response matching\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pending session request ID is valid (not -1)\n2. If invalid, return immediately (no pending request)\n3. Call D2MCPCLIENT.Ordinal_10007 to finalize the pending request\n4. Store the pending request ID in upper word of g_wLastSessionRequestId (offset +2)\n5. Clear the pending request ID by setting to -1 (marks as completed)\n6. Return\n\nParameters: None (void function)\n\nReturns: void\n\nGlobal State Modified:\n- g_nPendingSessionRequestId: Cleared to -1 after processing\n- g_wLastSessionRequestId: Upper word (offset +2) set to completed request ID\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- No-op when g_nPendingSessionRequestId is -1 (no pending request)\n- Upper word storage allows tracking both current and last request IDs\n\nOrdinal Calls:\n- Ordinal_10007 (D2MCPCLIENT.DLL): Finalizes/completes pending session request\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitiateGameListRequest: Sets g_wLastSessionRequestId._0_2_ (lower word)\n- This function sets g_wLastSessionRequestId._2_2_ (upper word)\n\nCalled By: Single caller at 0x6fa03836",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "API",
