      "name": "UpdateMaxPlayersToggleState",
      "signature": "void UpdateMaxPlayersToggleState(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Updates UI controls based on max players toggle button state.\n\nWhen the max players toggle is enabled (checked):\n- Disables difficulty buttons (sets bit mask to 0)\n- Enables max players edit boxes (sets bit mask to 1)\n- Sets text boxes with string 0x148b using color 4 (enabled style)\n\nWhen the max players toggle is disabled (unchecked):\n- Enables difficulty buttons (sets bit mask to 1)\n- Disables max players edit boxes (sets bit mask to 0)\n- Sets text boxes with string 0x148b using color 5 (disabled style)\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_pMaxPlayersToggleButton is valid via IsButtonValid\n2. If toggle is VALID (enabled):\n   a. Clear bit mask on g_pDifficultyButton1 and g_pDifficultyButton2\n   b. Set bit mask on g_pMaxPlayersEditBox1 and g_pMaxPlayersEditBox2\n   c. Set unit bit mask on g_pMaxPlayersInputField, EditBox1, EditBox2\n   d. Get localized string 0x148b, add to TextBox1 with color=4\n3. If toggle is INVALID (disabled):\n   a. Set bit mask on g_pDifficultyButton1 and g_pDifficultyButton2\n   b. Clear bit mask on g_pMaxPlayersEditBox1 and g_pMaxPlayersEditBox2\n   c. Clear unit bit mask on g_pMaxPlayersInputField, EditBox1, EditBox2\n   d. Get localized string 0x148b, add to TextBox1 with color=5\n4. Get localized string 0x148c, add to TextBox2 with same color\n5. Tail-call FUN_6fa105a0 to validate form state\n\nParameters: None (uses global UI control pointers)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSSA Temporaries (decompiler-generated, not actual stack variables):\n- iVar1: IsButtonValid return value (int, 0=invalid, non-zero=valid)\n- dVar2: Text color parameter (dword, 4=enabled, 5=disabled)\n- bVar3: Always 0, flag parameter for TextBoxAddText (byte)\n- wszText/wszText_00/wszText_01: ValidateStringId return values (wchar_t*)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x148b: String ID for max players label text\n- 0x148c: String ID for secondary label text\n- Color 4: Enabled text style\n- Color 5: Disabled text style\n\nCalled by: Single caller at 0x6fa0fcca (game creation dialog handler)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.04b",
