      "name": "ValidateAndProcessEntity",
      "signature": "int ValidateAndProcessEntity(int * pEntity)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Validates game entity and processes resource if flag conditions are met.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call entity validation function (FUN_6ff31731) with entity pointer\n2. If validation fails (returns non-zero), return error code -1\n3. Check entity flags byte at offset 0xd for resource processing flag (0x40)\n4. If resource flag not set, return success (0)\n5. If resource flag is set, call resource processing function (FUN_6ff3193d)\n6. Return negated boolean result from resource processing\n\nParameters:\npEntity (int *) - Pointer to game entity structure being validated/processed\n\nReturns:\n-1 - Entity validation failed\n 0 - Success (entity valid, no resource processing needed OR processing succeeded)\n<0 - Resource processing failed (returns -1 if processing function returns non-zero)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nFlag 0x40 at offset 0xd controls resource processing branch\nResource handle at entity[4] (offset 0x10) passed to processing function\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset  Size  Field Name           Type    Description\n0x00    4     field_0x0           uint    Unknown field\n0x04    4     field_0x4           uint    Unknown field  \n0x08    4     field_0x8           uint    Unknown field\n0x0c    1     field_0xc           byte    Unknown field\n0x0d    1     bFlags              byte    Entity flags (bit 0x40 = resource processing)\n0x0e    2     field_0xe           ushort  Unknown field\n0x10    4     dwResourceHandle    uint    Resource handle for processing",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:32830e9f516d2a1357be8c107a44798f",
