      "name": "ProcessChatInputCommand",
      "signature": "int ProcessChatInputCommand(wchar_t * pwszInput)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "ProcessChatInputCommand - Processes chat input text and handles slash commands\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset autocomplete index to -1 (0xffffffff)\n2. Get input string length; return 0 if empty\n3. Validate callback vtable exists (assert if null)\n4. Convert Unicode input to Windows ANSI (acStack_300)\n5. Copy ANSI string to temp buffer (abStack_400)\n6. Check if input starts with URL parameter suffix; if so, clear input and return 1\n7. Copy ANSI string to global command buffer (DAT_6fa214a8)\n8. If command starts with '/':\n   a. Backup autocomplete entries to DAT_6fa20ba4\n   b. Copy command to g_aszAutocompleteEntries\n   c. Increment entry count (max 10)\n   d. Check for specific commands:\n      - Match against DAT_6fa1d6d0 (empty command?)\n      - Match against \"/reply\"\n      - Match against \"/d2notify\" - toggle player notification flag\n   e. For d2notify: toggle DAT_6fa21890, display status message\n   f. For other commands: invoke vtable callback or show error\n9. If command does NOT start with '/':\n   a. Check vtable callback availability\n   b. If unavailable: validate string ID, create UI elements for input\n   c. If available: invoke callback, call FUN_6fa0cb60\n10. Clear current input field\n11. Calculate text box line count, scroll to bottom if needed\n12. Return 1\n\nParameters:\n  pwszInput - Unicode string containing chat input text\n\nReturns:\n  0 - Input was empty\n  1 - Input processed successfully\n\nGlobals Used:\n  g_dwAutocompleteCurrentIndex (0x6fa1b04c) - Current autocomplete selection\n  g_pCallbackVtable (0x6fa20a1c) - Callback interface vtable\n  g_pCurrentInputPointer (0x6fa218d0) - Current edit data pointer\n  g_aszAutocompleteEntries (0x6fa20aa4) - Autocomplete history array\n  g_dwAutocompleteEntryCount (0x6fa2188c) - Number of autocomplete entries\n  DAT_6fa21890 - Player notification toggle flag (d2notify)\n  g_nNumSubChildren - UI sub-children count\n  g_apSubChildrenArray - UI sub-children array\n  g_pCharSelectControl - Character select text box control\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Empty input returns 0 immediately\n  - Null callback vtable triggers assertion failure\n  - URL parameter suffix input clears field without processing\n  - /d2notify toggles player enter/leave notifications\n  - Autocomplete history limited to 10 entries\n\nNote: Function body appears truncated in Ghidra analysis. Documentation\nbased on initial decompiler output which showed full function logic.",
