      "name": "HandleChatInputEntry",
      "signature": "int HandleChatInputEntry(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "HandleChatInputEntry - Processes chat input when user presses Enter\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if command buffer starts with '/' (slash command)\n2. If slash command:\n   a. Backup autocomplete entries to g_aszAutocompleteBackup\n   b. Calculate command string length using strlen loop\n   c. Copy command to g_aszAutocompleteEntries history\n   d. Increment g_dwAutocompleteEntryCount (capped at 10)\n   e. Try HandleReplyWhisperCommand with \"/r\" prefix\n   f. If not handled, try HandleReplyWhisperCommand with \"/reply\"\n   g. If not handled, try TogglePlayerNotificationsOnNameMatch with \"/d2notify\"\n   h. If no command matched, check online mode via callback vtable\n   i. Online: invoke vtable callback at offset 0x14\n   j. Offline: ValidateStringId(0x14e7), call FUN_6fa06730\n3. If not slash command (regular chat message):\n   a. Check online mode via g_pCallbackVtable+0x74\n   b. If online: invoke send callback at vtable+0x14, call FUN_6fa0cb60\n   c. If offline: create UI panel with inventory button, secondary button, text box\n4. Clear input field via EditData_SetString with null\n5. Calculate text box line count and scroll to bottom if needed\n6. Dispatch all sub-children handlers and reset state\n7. Return 1 (always succeeds)\n\nParameters:\n  None - reads from global g_szCommandBuffer\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Always returns success\n\nGlobals Used:\n  g_szCommandBuffer (0x6fa214a8) - Input command string buffer\n  g_aszAutocompleteEntries - Autocomplete history array\n  g_aszAutocompleteBackup (0x6fa20ba4) - Backup of autocomplete entries\n  g_dwAutocompleteEntryCount - Number of stored autocomplete entries (max 10)\n  g_pCallbackVtable - Callback interface for online/offline mode\n  g_pCurrentInputPointer - Current edit data pointer\n  g_pCharSelectControl - Character select text box control\n  g_nNumSubChildren - UI sub-children count\n  g_apSubChildrenArray - UI sub-children array\n  g_dwCurrentInputItem - Current input item index\n  g_dwInventorySubState - Inventory panel sub-state\n  _g_pfnSubPanelCallback - Sub-panel callback function pointer\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Slash commands are added to autocomplete history before processing\n  - Autocomplete history limited to 10 entries\n  - Online mode sends via network callback; offline creates local UI panel\n  - Function always returns 1 regardless of command handling result\n\nNote: Function body appears truncated in Ghidra analysis (single instruction).\nDecompiler output shows full logic but formal variable list is empty.\nVariables documented from decompiler analysis only.",
