      "name": "InitializePanelByProfileSlot",
      "signature": "void InitializePanelByProfileSlot(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes panel display based on current profile slot selection state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reset profile edit panel and restore input handling via ResetProfileEditPanelAndRestoreInput()\n2. Check g_dwProfileSlotParam to determine panel category (0=standard, non-zero=alternate)\n3. If g_dwProfileSlotParam == 0 (standard panels):\n   a. If g_dwProfileSlotIndex == 0: Call InitializePanelDisplayDefault()\n   b. Else: Call InitializeOrResetInventoryPanel()\n4. Else (alternate panels, g_dwProfileSlotParam != 0):\n   a. If g_dwProfileSlotIndex == 0: Call InitializePanelMode2()\n   b. Else: Call InitializeOrResetCharSelPanel()\n5. Call InitializePanelDisplayText() with:\n   - lpszDisplayText = &g_szProfileCharacterName (profile character name string)\n   - nTextMode = g_dwProfileSlotIndex (slot index as text mode)\n   - nPanelType = g_dwProfileSlotParam (slot param as panel type)\n6. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  None (void)\n\nReturns:\n  uint - Always returns 1 (success)\n\nControl Flow Matrix:\n  g_dwProfileSlotParam | g_dwProfileSlotIndex | Panel Function Called\n  ---------------------|----------------------|----------------------\n  0                    | 0                    | InitializePanelDisplayDefault\n  0                    | non-zero             | InitializeOrResetInventoryPanel\n  non-zero             | 0                    | InitializePanelMode2\n  non-zero             | non-zero             | InitializeOrResetCharSelPanel\n\nCaller Context:\n  - Called via function pointer from address 0x6fa1cca0\n  - Part of panel initialization/selection system\n\nGlobal Variables:\n  - g_dwProfileSlotParam (0x6fa3e9f4): Panel category selector (READ)\n  - g_dwProfileSlotIndex (0x6fa3e9f0): Slot index within category (READ)\n  - g_szProfileCharacterName (0x6fa3e9e0): Profile character name string (READ)",
