      "comment": "Retrieves the profile sex value through a virtual method call.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Allocate 0xc bytes on stack for local variables\\n2. Store fastcall parameters (param1 in ECX, param2 in EDX)\\n3. Load object pointer from global data at 0x6fa0917c\\n4. Push output buffer address (sexBuffer) as first argument\\n5. Push string literal 0x6f9e9c28 (\\\"profile\\\\sex\\\") as second argument\\n6. Set EDX = 3 (operation code for get sex)\\n7. Call virtual method at offset 0x74 in object vtable\\n8. Clean up stack and return\\n\\nParameters:\\nparam1 (ECX): First parameter - caller context\\nparam2 (EDX): Second parameter - caller context\\n\\nReturns:\\nvoid - Output written to sexBuffer stack variable\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\nThe magic constant 3 in EDX indicates \\\"get sex\\\" operation code.\\nOutput buffer (sexBuffer) is 4 bytes allocated on stack.\\nThis function is part of a profile manager system using virtual methods for polymorphic behavior.",
