      "name": "CompareStringsWithLocaleInfo",
      "signature": "int CompareStringsWithLocaleInfo(char * pString1)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Compares two null-terminated strings using locale-aware character transformation.\nThis function performs a lexicographic comparison of two input strings, applying\nlocale-specific character processing via CheckAndProcessThreadLocaleInfo before\ncomparison. If the first string is shorter than the second, returns -1 immediately.\nHandles case-insensitive comparison for alphabetic characters based on locale settings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate length of pString1 by scanning for null terminator\n2. Calculate length of pString2 by scanning for null terminator\n3. If pString1 length < pString2 length, return -1 (failure)\n4. Reset counters and prepare for character-by-character comparison\n5. Loop through each character position up to pString2 length:\n   - Load byte from pString1 at current position\n   - Apply locale transformation via CheckAndProcessThreadLocaleInfo\n   - Load byte from pString2 at current position\n   - Apply locale transformation via CheckAndProcessThreadLocaleInfo\n   - Compare transformed values and break if unequal\n   - Advance both string pointers to next character\n6. If all characters matched, return 0 (equal strings)\n7. If mismatch found, return -1 if pString1 < pString2, or 1 if pString1 > pString2\n\nParameters:\n- pString1 (Stack[0x4]):  Pointer to first null-terminated string for comparison\n- pString2 (EAX):         Pointer to second null-terminated string (implicit, passed in EAX)\n\nReturns:\n- EAX = 0:  Strings are equal after locale transformation\n- EAX = -1: First string is less than second string (length or character comparison)\n- EAX = 1:  First string is greater than second string (character comparison)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If pString1 length < pString2 length, immediately returns -1\n- Null pointers or uninitialized strings cause undefined behavior\n- Locale processing depends on CheckAndProcessThreadLocaleInfo implementation\n- Stack cleanup on return: RET 0x4 (callee removes 1 parameter)\n",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:4ea65e007db067d708b775857d774d90",
