      "name": "InitializeGameSubsystems",
      "signature": "uint InitializeGameSubsystems(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes core game subsystems during startup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dispatch initial command handler (loads configuration)\n2. Initialize character creation UI subsystem\n3. Set rendering state configuration flag to 4\n4. Initialize rendering subsystem\n5. Return success status (1)\n\nReturns:\n1 on successful initialization\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- DAT_6fa0a0dc flag set to 4 indicates rendering subsystem initialization state\n- All three subsystem initializations must complete successfully\n- Called during game startup sequence before main loop",
