      "name": "ProcessGameClientEventLoop",
      "signature": "int ProcessGameClientEventLoop(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Main game client event loop processing network commands and rendering state.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize Unicode buffers (512 and 1024 elements) via default constructors\n2. Check mouse position in UI rect (0x91, 0xb, 0x28f, 0x47) and set system config accordingly\n3. Handle command timeout: if state==2 and tick delta >30000ms, reset and dispatch\n4. Enter main loop: process commands via virtual vtable call at offset +0x24\n5. Dispatch command types: 0=handler, 2=copy_memory, 3=finalize_character\n6. Call ProcessConnectionCommand to update state machine\n7. State machine (DAT_6fa09f20): 0=idle, 1=encoding, 2=processing, 3=active\n8. State 1: Check peer+global state, encode on state 0, advance to state 2\n9. State 2: Process large Unicode buffer with 11 global state cases\n10. State 3: Check peer and module instance, dispatch entity/UI operations\n11. Render timer: 15-second interval for main and secondary updates\n12. Encoding timer: 1-second interval for buffer operations\n13. Return 1 on early exit, 0 to continue loop based on render/command flags\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns:\n  int: 1 if processing completed or buffer available, 0 to continue loop, 1 early exit\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Timeout hardcoded to 30000ms (0x7530)\n  Render intervals: 15000ms (0x3a98), 1000ms (0x3e8)\n  Jump tables: 0x6f9e9bc8, 0x6f9e9c34, 0x6f9de068, 0x6f9de118\n  Global state region: DAT_6fa09f14 at multiple offset accesses\n  Unicode elements are 2-byte wide, arrays 512/1024 elements\n\nStructure Layout:\n  Global state (DAT_6fa09f14) field offsets:\n  Offset | Size | Field Name      | Type       | Description\n  +0x15  | 4    | state           | uint       | Game state (set to 3)\n  +0x19  | 2    | state_value     | ushort     | State value\n  +0x1b  | var  | encode_region   | uint[?]    | Encoding buffer\n  +0x229| 1    | status_flag     | byte       | Status indicator\n  +0x241| var  | ip_buffer       | char[?]    | Server IP address\n  +0x1eb| 2    | flags           | ushort     | Bit 3 and 2 flags\n  +0x225| 4    | buffer_state    | uint       | Buffer state value\n  +0x33 | var  | extra_data      | char[?]    | Additional data",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:4bac02b46dbc9cb5e31acf917bff509d",
