      "name": "ProcessProfileCreationUI",
      "signature": "void ProcessProfileCreationUI(char * pProfileData, int nUnknown)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes and processes profile/character creation UI screen.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validates input string pointer in EAX, advances if next character exists\n2. Initializes four game entity validation checks via repeated calls to 0x6f9d7c1a\n3. Sets up three local buffers as UI field handlers:\n   - fieldBuffer2 (offset ESP+0x44, 200 bytes) for token storage\n   - fieldBuffer1 (offset ESP+0x18, 36 bytes) for field buffer\n   - fieldBuffer2 (offset ESP+0xc, 12 bytes) for config buffer\n4. Calls virtual method at [DAT_6fa0917c + 0x78] with parameters (1, profile_sex_string)\n5. Clears game state flag at DAT_6fa09118 to 0\n6. Executes command dispatcher and rendering queue\n7. If DAT_6fa09118 remains 0, processes profile data:\n   a. Sets DAT_6fa09dac flag to 1\n   b. Executes ProcessGameCommand for multiple profile fields:\n      - 0x6f9eb650 (sex) -> renders to UI\n      - 0x6f9eb680 (class) -> renders to UI\n      - 0x6f9eb6b0 (difficulty) -> renders to UI\n      - 0x6f9eb6e0 (experience) -> renders to UI\n      - 0x6f9eb710 (character name)\n   c. Tokenizes character name buffer using Strtok with delimiter\n   d. For each token, calls RenderTextInUIControl\n   e. Executes ProcessGameCommand for 0x6f9eb830 (optional field)\n   f. Sets global state with command result\n   g. Conditionally executes ProcessGameCommand for 0x6f9eb860\n   h. Calls FUN_6f9e1600 for additional processing\n   i. Sets active UI control if DAT_6fa0a0d0 is non-zero\n   j. Copies string from EDI to global DAT_6fa09dd4 until null terminator\n   k. Stores stack values at DAT_6fa09de4 and DAT_6fa09de8\n8. Returns to caller, removing 0x8 bytes from stack\n\nParameters:\n- pProfileData (EAX): Pointer to profile data string or structure\n- nUnknown (Stack): Second parameter, purpose unclear\n\nReturns:\n- void: No return value (status indicated via global state updates)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- String validation advances pointer until next non-null character found\n- Early exit triggered if DAT_6fa09118 becomes non-zero during processing\n- Conditional processing of 0x6f9eb860 command only if DAT_6fa0a094 is 0\n- String copy uses EDI as source pointer with size calculated from DAT_6fa09dd4",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
