      "name": "InitializeCharacterCreationUI",
      "signature": "void InitializeCharacterCreationUI(undefined4 contextData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initializes character creation UI with validation and structure setup.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate character properties (class, sex, description) via 4x ValidateAndSetEntityMode calls\n2. Initialize local stack buffers: sexBuffer (4 bytes), classBuffer (36 bytes), descriptionBuffer (200 bytes)\n3. Store buffer pointers to globals: 0x6fa09188, 0x6fa0918c, 0x6fa09190\n4. Invoke UI control function via virtual function pointer [0x6fa0917c + 0x78] with param 1 and string at 0x6f9e9c28\n5. Clear initialization flag: 0x6fa09118 = 0\n6. Dispatch command handler and process rendering queue\n7. If 0x6fa09118 == 0 (no errors):\n   a. Validate and render UI elements (FUN_6f9dbe00)\n   b. Initialize field globals via ProcessGameCommand for 5 data sources (0x6f9eb560, 0x6f9eb590, 0x6f9eb5c0, 0x6f9eb5f0, 0x6f9eb620)\n   c. Set global state via ProcessGameCommand for context (0x6f9eb800)\n   d. Conditional initialization: if 0x6fa0a094 == 0, process additional field (0x6f9eb860)\n   e. Call FUN_6f9e1600 for final UI setup\n   f. Link structures bidirectionally 3 times\n   g. Check validation fields: if all empty, activate field at 0x6fa09d80; else activate 0x6fa09d88 and handle double-click\n   h. Copy string data from offset sourceAddr to 0x6fa09dd4 until null terminator\n8. Store contextData and return address to globals before exit\n\nParameters:\n  contextData (undefined4) - Context information passed to initialization (stored at 0x6fa09de8)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nStructure Layout:\nOffset  Size  Field Name                   Type        Description\n------  ----  -------------------------  ----------  --------------------------------\n0x6fa09d80  4     active_field_1             pointer     Sex/gender field UI element\n0x6fa09d84  4     active_field_2             pointer     Class field UI element  \n0x6fa09d88  4     active_field_3             pointer     Description field UI element\n0x6fa09dac  4     field_mode                 int         UI mode flag (set to 2)\n0x6fa09de4  4     saved_return_addr          pointer     Saved return address\n0x6fa09de8  4     saved_context              int         Stored context parameter\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If 0x6fa09118 != 0 during validation, skip entire UI initialization\n- If 0x6fa0a094 != 0, skip additional field processing (0x6f9eb860)\n- Magic number 0x6f9e9c28 is a string pointer for UI control initialization\n- Local buffer sizes: sexBuffer=4, classBuffer=36, descriptionBuffer=200 (total 240 bytes)\n- All validation fields (classValidation, sexValidation, descValidation) use stack at ESP+8, ESP+0x14, ESP+0x40",
