      "name": "FormatAndSendWhisperMessage",
      "signature": "void FormatAndSendWhisperMessage(int playerNameIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Formats and sends a whisper message to the game message system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate 500-byte buffer on stack for message string\n2. Call sprintf to format message using template \"You whisper to {s}: {s}\"\n3. Pass formatted message buffer and message type (2=whisper) to message handler\n4. Return void\n\nParameters:\nplayerNameIndex (ECX): Index into player name list used in sprintf for message formatting\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nSpecial Cases:\nBuffer size is fixed at 500 bytes - may truncate very long whisper messages\nMessage type code 2 indicates whisper message in the message handler system\nUses fastcall convention with first parameter in ECX register",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:40b16f5df87f4951946ce8edb96189c9",
