      "name": "ProcessCharacterSlotSelection",
      "signature": "uint ProcessCharacterSlotSelection(int * pSlotData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Processes character slot selection and initializes UI accordingly.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Search slot lookup table for matching identifier in pSlotData[0]\\n2. If found, calculate adjusted slot index from lookup table\\n3. If pSlotData[1] == 0x205 (special slot): Find profile path in slot name\\n4. If normal slot: Validate character data and initialize creation UI\\n5. Return success status (1 for success, 0 for failure)\\n\\nParameters:\\n- pSlotData: Pointer to slot data structure containing identifier and type flags\\n\\nReturns:\\n- 1 on success (character initialized or profile processed)\\n- 0 on failure (slot not found in lookup table)\\n\\nStructure Layout (Game Slot Data):\\nOffset  Size  Field         Type      Description\\n------  ----  -----         ----      -----------\\n+0x0    4     slotId        dword     Slot identifier (searched in lookup)\\n+0x4    4     slotType      dword     Slot type/flags (0x205 = special)\\n+0x36   ?     nameBuffer    char[]    Character name buffer\\n+0x89   ?     profilePath   char[]    Profile path for string comparison\\n+0x9c   4     charPtr       dword     Pointer to character data\\n+0xa0   4     namePtr       void*     Pointer to profile name string\\n+0xa8   4     unknown       dword     Unknown field (param to processing)\\n+0xb0   4     nextSlot      void*     Linked list pointer to next slot",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:7c6c3ff09528b61d16615592ed8a3a41",
