      "comment": "Processes incoming command strings with rate throttling and wildcard expansion.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if command buffer pointer is valid (DAT_6fa09f08)\n2. Copy command string from global buffer to local buffer\n3. Get current system time via GetTickCount()\n4. Check if 1000ms threshold has elapsed since last execution\n5. If threshold met, search for '*' (wildcard) character in command\n6. Determine output substring: if wildcard found and not null-terminated, use substring after wildcard; otherwise use full string\n7. Format output string via sprintf using found substring\n8. Call pre-dispatch setup routine (FUN_6f9de860)\n9. Check dispatch result by calling vtable function at offset +0x68\n10. If dispatch returns 0, dispatch command handler and cleanup, return 0\n11. If dispatch returns non-zero, call vtable function at offset +0x14 for alternate processing\n12. Call unicode callback processor\n13. Return 1 if buffer pointer invalid or execution skipped\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\n0 if command dispatch completed successfully\n1 if throttled or buffer pointer invalid",
