      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initialize game mode state after entity validation.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Validate current game entity modes via ValidateGameEntityModes()\\n2. Set initial entity mode via ValidateAndSetEntityMode()\\n3. Check if current state is not in modes 0x9 (invalid) or 0x0 (zero)\\n4. If valid state: Set timeout to 1000ms, initialize resource state, mark as initialized\\n5. Calculate and set inventory offset for current mode\\n6. Reset inventory state counter\\n7. Return success (1) regardless of state validation\\n\\nParameters:\\n- None\\n\\nReturns:\\n- int: Always returns 1 (success)\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n- State values 0x9 and 0x0 skip resource initialization\\n- Timeout hardcoded to 1000ms (0x3e8)\\n- Inventory offset calculated from current game mode state",
